<title>NETHERLANDS: Labouchere rates Stork a Buy.</title>
<headline>Labouchere rates Stork a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research note.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Stork	     Engineering   73.50   Bank Labouchere</p>
<p>COMMENT: BUY. Fokker Aviation acquisition will have positive impact on 1996 results. 1996 net earnings will be at least 20 pct above 1995 earnings. Stork has strong positions in its markets worldwide and sound growth opportunities. At a 1997 P/E of 12.3 and 1998 P/E of 11.3 the shares trade at a 20 pct discount to the market and are undervalued. </p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS    P/E   Cashflow   P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		  4.49   13.6    8.59     7.1    1.80</p>
<p>    1997		  5.80   12.7   10.06     7.3    2.30</p>
<p>    1998		  6.34   11.6   10.87     6.8    2.50</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
